# Global Modal · Same Color · Same Font (LOCKED)

**User order:** Har modal ka color/font **global Holst branding** se aaye — BrandingPanel / `portal-tokens.css` CSS vars. Ek-ek modal fix; naya hardcoded palette mat banao.

## Absolute
- **NO** hardcoded modal headers like `#0b1b36`, random `bg-blue-600` / `bg-emerald-600` CTAs inside dashboard modals.
- Header → `background: var(--portal-cta)` (same global CTA as primary buttons); icon → white.
- Primary actions (Upload / Media Library / Save) → `unity-btn-primary` / `var(--portal-cta)` — no dark `portal-950` secondary fill.
- Surfaces / inputs / text → `var(--surface)`, `var(--input-bg)`, `var(--input-fg)`, `var(--border)`, `var(--text)`, `var(--muted)`, `var(--accent)`.
- Font → inherit `var(--font-ui)` via `GlobalModal` (`data-global-modal`) — never a one-off face on modal chrome.
- Shell → always `GlobalModal` (body portal). Dropdowns → `PortalSelect` / `SaudiCitySelect` / `FloatingPopover` (above modal z-index).

## City / select click
- `FloatingPopover` outside-dismiss must **not** `preventDefault` / `stopPropagation` on the activating click (blocks the next field, e.g. City after Gender).
- Keep modal backdrop ignore while `[data-floating-popover]` is mounted (already in `GlobalModal`).

## Scope
- Master + Store admin modals only (not locked storefront theme chrome).
- Fix the open modal in front of you; leave already-tokenized modals alone.
